AIHack derivative-work notice
=============================

AIHack is a derivative reimplementation of NetHack 3.6.7. The project was
created by studying the original NetHack 3.6.7 source and using AI-assisted semantic rewrite
techniques to reconstruct its intended observable behavior in a substantially
different Rust architecture.

